<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Berjaya Land net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Berjaya Land net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		104.74	  vs	   26.22</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)   20.0	   vs	    6.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		2,377.77	  vs	2,116.64</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  308.23	  vs	  157.39</p>
<p>    Minorities    less     95.97	  vs  less   61.99</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 128.81	  vs	  236.75</p>
<p>    Dividend     (percent) 21.0	   vs	   12.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Berjaya Land Bhd, formerly known as Berjaya Leisure Bhd, is in property development and hotel management.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
